<title>USA: Chromaline Corp to split stock.</title>
<headline>Chromaline Corp to split stock.</headline>
<dateline>DULUTH, Minn. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chromaline Corp said Thursday its board of directors has approved a three-for-two split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split will apply to shareholders of record at the close of business on August 27, 1997, who will receive one additional share for each two shares then held. Distribution is expected to be made on September 19, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>After the current three-for-two split the company will have 1.2 million shares outstanding,the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
